  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Allow type relays for the same type only if they have disjunct scope\n\t\t\tUsing<TTarget>().From(values): provide an explicit list of values as the value space of a type\n\t\t\tTemporal sources (DateTime, DateTimeOffset, DateOnly, TimeOnly, TimeSpan) support StartingAt and Spaced, mirroring numeric sequences\n\t\t\tSequences with a fixed spacing use constant memory, supporting generation of very large value sets\n\t\t\tTargets .NET 8, .NET 9 and .NET 10\n\t\t\tBreaking: removed the obsolete Using<TTarget, TSource> and And<TTarget, TSource> methods",
